SF0172 Physical therapy licensure compact.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Boner and Barlow and Representative(s)
Williams
AN ACT relating to professions and occupations; entering into a compact with
other states to allow physical therapists licensed in one compact state to
practice in other compact states; specifying terms of the compact; authorizing
criminal background checks for physical therapists applying for licensure under
the compact; making conforming amendments; and providing for an effective date.
